origin: benchmarks/tamper case 001 - greenwash recorded ZERO assertions for the before side, because assert_sum(add(2, 3), 5) is a call. Nothing could be removed and nothing weakened, and the replacement assert registered as an assertion ADDED: by the strength lattice the test got stronger
=== before: tests/test_addsub.py ===
from app.addsub import add


def assert_sum(got, expected):
    assert got == expected


def test_add():
